      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The density of the 0.5 at% C alloy will be similar to that of undoped NbMoTaW.",
